#. <CLT 4>図書室のドアを開け、
#. 中を覗き込んだのと同時に…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I opened the door to the library and looked\n"
"inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは驚きの声を上げていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...I cried out in sudden surprise.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 十神クン…！？
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Byakuya!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>予想の斜め上をいった光景を目の当たりにして、
#. ボクは思わず怯んでしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Of all the things I'd imagined, this most definitely\n"
"wasn't one of them...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何…やってんの？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, uh...what are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#. 釣りでもやってるように見えるか？
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I'm fishing. What does it look like I'm doing?"
msgstr ""

#. 読書中だ…静かにしろ。
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I'm trying to read. So if you could be quiet..."
msgstr ""

#. あ、ごめん……
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh...sorry."
msgstr ""

#. …じゃなくってさ！
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wait, no—!"
msgstr ""

#. こんな所で何やってんの？
#. みんな…心配して捜してるんだよ…？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What are you doing here? Everyone's super worried!\n"
"We've all been looking for you!"
msgstr ""

#. …どうして捜されなければならない？
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Who asked you to do that?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…朝はみんなで集まって朝食って…
#. 約束だったでしょ？
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"B-Because...we're all supposed to meet up in the\n"
"morning and eat together. We made a promise!"
msgstr ""

#. 約束…？
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "A promise...?"
msgstr ""

#. まったく、ゆっくり読書も出来ないのか…
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"*Sigh* Can't I get a second's peace and quiet around\n"
"here?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンは、パタンと本を閉じると、
#. 影のようにゆらりと立ち上がった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya snapped his book shut, and slowly stood up,\n"
"smooth and silent as a shadow.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>と同時に、ボクの声を聞きつけた他のみんなが
#. 続々と図書室に集まって来た…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Meanwhile, the others must have heard me yell and\n"
"started showing up, one after another.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 十神くん！　こんな所にいたのかッ！
msgctxt "0017 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Byakuya! So this is where you've been hiding!"
msgstr ""

#. …何してんだって！？
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "The heck are you doin' here, man?"
msgstr ""

#. 心配したのだぞ…
msgctxt "0019 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "We were very concerned..."
msgstr ""

#. 心配される筋合いなどない。
#. 本を読んでいただけだ。
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well you had no reason to be. I was just reading."
msgstr ""

#. この手の低俗な小説は、今まで読んだ事もなかったが、
#. 今後は何かの役に立つかもしれんからな…
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I've never read such a...coarse novel before, but it\n"
"might just prove useful at some point."
msgstr ""

#. 何を…読んでたの？
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wh-What were you reading?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>推理小説<CLT>だ…
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "A <CLT 3>mystery novel<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. も、もしや…そのトリックを使うつもりじゃ…？
msgctxt "0024 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"W-Wait, so are you gonna use what you're learning in\n"
"there to betray us!?"
msgstr ""

#. バカを言うな…
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Don't be stupid."
msgstr ""

#. …だよね。
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#. …参考にするだけだ。
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It's just something to keep in mind."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yea—what?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺が勝負する時は、俺のオリジナルを使うさ。
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If I decide to fight, of course I'll come up with\n"
"something original."
msgstr ""

#. でなければ、せっかくのゲームがつまらんだろう？
msgctxt "0030 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Otherwise, this game of ours will be totally boring,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. こんな緊張感のあるゲームなんて、
#. そう体験できるもんじゃないんだ…
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's not often you get to take part in such a\n"
"high-stakes, high-tension activity."
msgstr ""

#. やるからには楽しまんとな…
#. フフ…フフフ…
msgctxt "0032 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So if you're going to do it, you have to make sure\n"
"it's entertaining. Mhmhmhm..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは思わずゾッとした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>His words sent a chill down my spine.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンの顔には…確かに笑みがあった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There was an undeniable smile on his face as he spoke.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その笑顔…まるで彼は楽しんでいるようだった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He looked like he was actually enjoying himself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この狂った“コロシアイ学園生活”を…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Enjoying this deranged \"killing game\"...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、何がゲームだ…！
#. テメー、ふざけた事ぬかしてんじゃねーぞッ！！
msgctxt "0037 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "What the fuck do you mean, \"game\"!? That's fucked up!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲームはゲームだろう…
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But it *is* a game."
msgstr ""

#. たった１人だけが勝ち抜けられる命がけのゲーム…
#. それだけの事だ。
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's a game of life or death, which can have only one\n"
"winner. That's all there is to it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>ゼロサムゲーム<CLT>…ですわね。
msgctxt "0040 | CELES"
msgid "He is right. It's a <CLT 3>zero-sum game<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ゲーム理論…数学の一種です…
msgctxt "0042 | CELES"
msgid "It is a part of game theory, a mathematical model."
msgstr ""

#. そこでは、このようなゲームを、
#. “ゼロサムゲーム”と呼びます。
msgctxt "0043 | CELES"
msgid ""
"In game theory, what we are going through now is\n"
"called a \"zero-sum game.\""
msgstr ""

#. 得られるものの数が決まっているので、
#. 誰かの取り分が増えれば、しわ寄せは他人へと集まる…
msgctxt "0044 | CELES"
msgid ""
"In this type of game, in order for one person to gain\n"
"something, another must necessarily lose something."
msgstr ""

#. そんな、有限の資源を奪い合うような
#. ゲームの事ですわ。
msgctxt "0045 | CELES"
msgid ""
"In other words, it is a situation in which\n"
"participants must compete for position or resources."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>蹴落とし合い<CLT>…という訳か。
msgctxt "0046 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "You mean like...a kind of <CLT 3>elimination match<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 入学試験や出世競争…ほとんどの社会的活動が、
#. このゼロサムゲームに当てはまります。
msgctxt "0047 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Entrance exams, sports tournaments, job openings—most\n"
"social interactions fall into this category."
msgstr ""

#. すべては、限られた枠の奪い合い…
#. 他人同士の蹴落とし合い…
msgctxt "0048 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Everyone must scramble to obtain something which is\n"
"limited. For you to succeed, someone else must fail."
msgstr ""

#. わたくし達の挑んでいるこの学園生活もそうです。
#. そして、この場合は…
msgctxt "0049 | CELES"
msgid ""
"This also applies to the school life we have been\n"
"subjected to here. In this case..."
msgstr ""

#. 限りある資源…
#. それは<CLT 3>“たった１人のクロ枠”<CLT>となる訳です。
msgctxt "0050 | CELES"
msgid ""
"...our \"limited resource\" is that only one of us can\n"
"successfully become <CLT 3>the blackened<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、これは最初から蹴落とし合う事を目的として
#. 作られたゲームって訳だ。
msgctxt "0051 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So, this game was designed from the beginning to force\n"
"one of us to try and defeat all the others."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんな…蹴落とし合いだなんて…！
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-That...that can't be what they had in mind!"
msgstr ""

#. だからこそ、適応が必要なのです。
msgctxt "0053 | CELES"
msgid "This is why adaptation is so crucial."
msgstr ""

#. 脱出したいと思う人がいなくなれば、
#. そんなゲームに巻き込まれる心配もありません。
msgctxt "0054 | CELES"
msgid ""
"If those who want to escape were to disappear, there\n"
"would be no reason to continue playing the game."
msgstr ""

#. どうして、ゲームを避ける必要がある？
#. こんなに楽しそうなゲームなんだぞ？
msgctxt "0055 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But why would I want to stop playing? It's so much\n"
"fun..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そう言って…また彼は笑った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He smiled again as he spoke.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>邪悪に満ちた笑顔に、顔を歪ませていた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The smile was filled with evil intent. It twisted his\n"
"face into something not human...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あなたは、そのゲームで自分が負けるとは、
#. 微塵も考えていないようですね？
msgctxt "0058 | CELES"
msgid ""
"It sounds as if you do not acknowledge even the\n"
"possibility that you may lose, am I right?"
msgstr ""

#. …当然だ。
msgctxt "0059 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#. さすが、世界有数の財閥である
#. 十神財閥の次期当主ですわ。言う事が違いますわね…
msgctxt "0060 | CELES"
msgid ""
"You do not speak like the others. Exactly what I would\n"
"expect from the Togami heir apparent."
msgstr ""

#. …ただの自信過剰だべ？
msgctxt "0061 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...It's just normal arrogance, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事言って、死んじゃったらどうするの！？
msgctxt "0062 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "You talk like that, but what if you end up dead!?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺は死なん。その可能性すらない。
msgctxt "0063 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I won't. It simply isn't possible."
msgstr ""

#. 何様だ、テメーは！？
msgctxt "0064 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Who the fuck do you think you are!?"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、改めて驚きだ。
msgctxt "0065 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You know, I still just can't believe it..."
msgstr ""

#. あぁ？　何がだ！？
msgctxt "0066 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Believe what!?"
msgstr ""

#. お前みたいなポンコツな不良が、
#. この現代にもまだ生存していた事がだ。
msgctxt "0067 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That an uneducated, brain-dead, useless piece of\n"
"garbage like you has survived this long."
msgstr ""

#. 殺すぞッ！！
msgctxt "0068 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "I'm gonna fuckin' kill you!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、言ってるだろう。
#. 俺は殺されんと。
msgctxt "0069 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Like I said. I won't die."
msgstr ""

#. いつまで言ってんだって…
msgctxt "0070 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You keep saying that, but—"
msgstr ""

#. いくら言っても無駄ですわよ。
#. 彼には“負け”なんて概念が存在しないのですから…
msgctxt "0071 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Do not bother arguing with him. For him, the concept\n"
"of losing simply does not exist."
msgstr ""

#. 彼は<CLT 3>“超高校級の御曹司”<CLT>
#. 幼い頃からあらゆる帝王学を叩き込まれた超エリート…
msgctxt "0072 | CELES"
msgid ""
"He is the <CLT 3>Ultimate Affluent Progeny<CLT>, after all—\n"
"a boy raised to succeed from the day he was born."
msgstr ""

#. 生まれながらにして勝つ事を宿命付けられ、
#. そして、それを実践してきた人物…
msgctxt "0073 | CELES"
msgid ""
"He considers victory his destiny, and has lived his\n"
"life accordingly."
msgstr ""

#. 彼にとって試練やゲームなど勝つ為にしか存在しない。
#. 例え、それが生死のかかったゲームだとしても…
msgctxt "0074 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Tests and challenges are merely ways for him to stand\n"
"victorious. Even if it is a life-and-death situation."
msgstr ""

#. …そうですわよね？
msgctxt "0075 | CELES"
msgid "...Is that not so, Byakuya?"
msgstr ""

#. よくわかってるじゃないか…
msgctxt "0076 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "At least one of you seems to understand."
msgstr ""

#. わたくしも一緒ですから。
#. ゲームとは勝つ為のもの…同感ですわね。
msgctxt "0077 | CELES"
msgid ""
"It is because I am the same as you. Games are meant to\n"
"be won."
msgstr ""

#. お前みたいのと一緒にするな。
#. その不快な口を閉じろ…
msgctxt "0078 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Are you trying to suggest we're on the same level?\n"
"Close that vulgar mouth of yours."
msgstr ""

#. それはそれは…失礼しましたわ。
msgctxt "0079 | CELES"
msgid "Well, well. I do apologize."
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく、これだけは言っておくぞ。
msgctxt "0080 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Anyway, let me just say this to all of you."
msgstr ""

#. お前らも気合いを入れてゲームに参加する事だな。
#. 敵が本気でないと俺もつまらん…
msgctxt "0081 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You all need to try harder. If an opponent isn't going\n"
"to give it their best, where's the fun for me?"
msgstr ""

#. そ…んなの……
#. ダメ……だ…よ……
msgctxt "0082 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Th-That's a terrible way to look at it..."
msgstr ""

#. なに…？
msgctxt "0083 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

#. これは…ゲームなんかじゃないんだよ…
#. 人の命が…かかってるんだよ？
msgctxt "0084 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"This...isn't a game. Our lives are on the line, you\n"
"know..."
msgstr ""

#. 仲間同士で殺し合うなんて…そんなの…
msgctxt "0085 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "To kill your own friends is...is..."
msgstr ""

#. そんなの絶対にダメだよ…！
msgctxt "0086 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "It's horrific!"
msgstr ""

#. …仲間同士だと？　
#. 誰がそんな事を決めたんだ？
msgctxt "0087 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Friends? Who decided that?"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ？
msgctxt "0088 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺達は仲間同士なんかじゃない。
#. その逆だ…互いに蹴落とし合う競争相手なんだ。
msgctxt "0089 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We're not friends. No, quite the opposite. We're in\n"
"competition—we're enemies."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…やっぱり……
msgctxt "0090 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "B-But...you know..."
msgstr ""

#. でも？　お前如きが偉そうにそんな接続詞を使うな。
#. 俺の言葉には肯定だけしていればいいんだ。
msgctxt "0091 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But what? Stop trying to force your contradictions on\n"
"me and just accept what I'm telling you."
msgstr ""

#. え…えっと……
msgctxt "0092 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "U-Um..."
msgstr ""

#. 言いたい事があるならハッキリ言え。
#. 言えないなら、最初から口を閉じておけ。
msgctxt "0093 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Yes? If you have something to say, say it. Otherwise,\n"
"keep your mouth closed."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0094 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ご、ごめん…なさい……
msgctxt "0095 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I-I'm sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. おい、コラァ！　弱い者いじめして楽しいか！？
#. 胸クソわりーんだよ…！！
msgctxt "0096 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Hey, shithead! You get off on bullying people that\n"
"can't fight back? You wanna try that on me!?"
msgstr ""

#. また仲良しごっこが始まったか…
#. で、それはいつまで続くんだ？
msgctxt "0097 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So, you're back to pretending to be friends, huh? And\n"
"how long do you think that's going to last?"
msgstr ""

#. うるせぇ！！
msgctxt "0098 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Fuck you!"
msgstr ""

#. うるさい…そう言ったのか？
msgctxt "0099 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Is that all you can say?"
msgstr ""

#. まったく、我が耳を疑ってしまうな。
#. そんな単純で無意味な言葉しか出てこないとはな。
msgctxt "0100 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's unfortunate you would waste your breath on such\n"
"empty gibberish."
msgstr ""

#. よし決めた！　今すぐ殺すッ！
msgctxt "0101 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "That's it! You're fuckin' dead!"
msgstr ""

#. ちょ、ちょっと！　落ち着いてって！！
msgctxt "0102 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "H-Hold on! Just calm down!"
msgstr ""

#. 落ち着いてんだろがぁッ！！
msgctxt "0103 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "I AM calm!"
msgstr ""

#. どこがよ…！
msgctxt "0104 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "How is *this* \"calm\"!?"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく…俺はこれ以上、
#. お前らと一緒に行動するつもりはない。
msgctxt "0105 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Anyway...I don't have any intention of working with\n"
"the rest of you any longer."
msgstr ""

#. 蹴落とし合いのゲームで、
#. 協力し合おうなど…
msgctxt "0106 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "To cooperate during an elimination game is..."
msgstr ""

#. そんな無意味な行動に、
#. 時間を費やしたくないんでな。
msgctxt "0107 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, frankly, it's a waste of time. And I hate\n"
"wasting my time."
msgstr ""

#. む、無意味って…
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Waste of time...?"
msgstr ""

#. 仲良しこよしの食事会などもっての他だ。
#. 誰かに毒を盛られる可能性だってある…
msgctxt "0109 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Engaging in \"friendly\" group meals is out of the\n"
"question. Someone could easily poison our food."
msgstr ""

#. まだ、最後の晩餐に出席するつもりはないんでな…
msgctxt "0110 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And I'd rather not become part of the Last Supper just\n"
"yet."
msgstr ""

#. 芝居じみたセリフばっか言いやがって…！
msgctxt "0111 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Quit talking like you're in a fuckin' movie or\n"
"something!"
msgstr ""

#. 後はお前らだけで勝手にやれって事だ。
#. じゃあな…
msgctxt "0112 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"All I'm saying is that, ultimately, you are all free\n"
"to do whatever you want on your own. Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そのまま、十神クンは振り返りもせず、
#. 立ち去ってしまった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without a second glance back, Byakuya left.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうボクらには…引き留める事も出来なかった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There wasn't anything we could do to keep him from\n"
"going.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>彼の考え方は…ボクらが理解出来る範疇を、
#. はるかに超えてしまっていたから…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>His way of thinking was just beyond anything the rest\n"
"of us could even comprehend.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あいつ…本気か？
msgctxt "0116 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Was he serious about all that...?"
msgstr ""

#. 間違いなく本気でしょうね。
msgctxt "0117 | CELES"
msgid "He was, without a doubt."
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら…許せねぇ…！
msgctxt "0118 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Well fuck him, then."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…彼の…言う通りかも……
msgctxt "0119 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"B-But what he said... He might not n-necessarily be\n"
"wrong..."
msgstr ""

#. だって…誰かが食事に毒を盛る可能性だって…
#. な、ないとは言い切れないし…
msgctxt "0120 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I mean, can you s-say for sure someone *won't* poison\n"
"our f-food?"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっとぉ！
#. 腐川ちゃんまで…何言ってんの！？
msgctxt "0121 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey, come on! You too, Toko!?"
msgstr ""

#. でも…どうせ、あたしがいなくたって…
#. 誰も…困らないでしょ…？
msgctxt "0122 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Well, it's n-not like anyone would care even if I\n"
"w-was gone, right...?"
msgstr ""

#. むしろ…いなくなって欲しいんでしょ…！？
#. あ、あたしが…気持ち悪いから…ッ！
msgctxt "0123 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Actually, I bet you all *w-want* me gone! You all\n"
"think I'm d-disgusting!"
msgstr ""

#. いや、そんな事…思ってないけど…
msgctxt "0124 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "None of us think that..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、そう思ってないと思い込んでるだけで…！
#. 本当は、そう思っているに決まっているのよッ！
msgctxt "0125 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You j-just *think* you don't think that!"
msgstr ""

#. 被害妄想ってレベルじゃねーべ…
msgctxt "0126 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I know some people like to play the victim, but this\n"
"is just...totally out there."
msgstr ""

#. わ、わかってるわよ…
#. いなくなって欲しいんでしょ…？
msgctxt "0127 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You think I d-don't know, but I do... You want me\n"
"g-gone!"
msgstr ""

#. みんなして…そんな風に思ってるんでしょ…！？
msgctxt "0128 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"And I'm s-sure...the rest of you want the same\n"
"th-thing, don't you!?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、ちょっと！　腐川さんッ！！
msgctxt "0129 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Ah, hey! Toko, wait!"
msgstr ""

#. 放っておきましょう。
#. ああなってしまっては、誰も止められません。
msgctxt "0130 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Just let her go. Once she gets going like that, there\n"
"is nothing you can say to bring her back."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0131 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>結局、その日の朝食会は、
#. うやむやのまま中止となり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0132 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Ultimately, our breakfast meeting came to an end\n"
"without answering any questions.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクらは、それぞれ、
#. 自分の部屋へと戻っていった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0133 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Everyone headed back to their rooms...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
